false" bounds="[0,72][1236,2676]" drawing-order="1" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.myvault.app" content-desc="Page 1: MyVault Stage 5 PDF Reader Verification &#13;&#10; &#13;&#10;This document exists only to verify the production PDF reader on the isolated em&#13;&#10;ulator. &#13;&#10;The first paragraph spans several visual lines so that a selected-text highlight&#13;&#10; can be checked across multiple line rectangles without collapsing into one over&#13;&#10;sized bounding box. &#13;&#10; &#13;&#10;English and Arabic mixed direction check: &#13;&#10;العلم النافع یحتاج إلى فھم وتدبر .reading careful through preserved is Knowledge&#13;&#10;. &#13;&#10; &#13;&#10;Reader behavior checklist: &#13;&#10;- Continuous vertical scrolling &#13;&#10;- Pinch zoom and pan &#13;&#10;- Exact selected-text copy &#13;&#10;- Multi-line highlight geometry &#13;&#10;- Notes, tags, and Study links &#13;&#10;- Page activity and navigation &#13;&#10; &#13;&#10;Second section &#13;&#10;The geometry on this page should remain anchored when the viewport width changes&#13;&#10;, when the Explorer opens and closes, and when the user returns from another doc&#13;&#10;ument. &#13;&#10;Repeated text for scrolling verification. &#13;&#10;Line 01: The reader should remain responsive and stable. &#13;&#10;Line 02: The toolbar must not remount the PDF document. &#13;&#10;Line 03: Highlights should stay attached to selected text. &#13;&#10;Line 04: Page notes should remain distinct from text notes. &#13;&#10;Line 05: Historic text boxes remain visible but read-only. &#13;&#10;Line 06: Activity entries navigate to the correct page. &#13;&#10;Line 07: Search and filters operate on real annotation data. &#13;&#10;Line 08: Dark and OLED themes retain a white PDF paper canvas. &#13;&#10;Line 09: Immersive mode restores chrome on a deliberate tap. &#13;&#10;Line 10: Reading progress resumes after reopening the document. &#13;&#10; &#13;&#10;Page break marker &#13;&#10;This final section gives the document enough content for vertical scrolling and &#13;&#10;page navigation. The implementation must preserve AndroidX PDF rendering, real t&#13;&#10;ext selection, zoom, and pan while replacing only the surrounding presentation." checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,559][1236,2159]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node></node></node></node></node></node></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.myvault.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[1106,1302][1236,1446]" drawing-order="1" hint=""><node index="0" text="2" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myvault.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[1195,1341][1212,1407]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.myvault.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,72][1236,246]" drawing-order="2" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.myvault.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[24,87][168,231]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" packag